{"seq":16,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/claude-code-opus-none-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T15:15:23.299Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"e3e225bde58b8667ff311476340bd697527a0bc04c87ec6301283cdb22fe9228","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana, I went through all six of Moss's notes in the shared files (the North and Central team digests). Two of them have Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers:\n\n• *#PD-4492*: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell filed it on 4 Oct 2025 because the gatehouse kiosk wasn't sending SMS bay assignments for Dock Doors 14–18 at the Eau Claire yard. Support patched it that evening and Thea confirmed it was fixed on 5 Oct.\n• *#4419*: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing.\n\nA few things to watch for:\n• #4409 and #4412 in \"Moss: Central handoffs next week\" are for Marrow Fieldworks, not QFL. FR-882 in the same note is a Marrow Agrisupply feature request.\n• The cheat sheet warns not to confuse QFL with *Quarendon Freightways*, which is a competitor's customer, not ours.\n• Moss's other QFL notes (the 14 Sep 2025 pipeline digest and the 23 Mar 2026 renewal check-in) don't have any ticket numbers.\n• I couldn't find any Moss notes filed under members/moss, and Moss hasn't posted in the channels you're in. So this list only covers the team digests."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
